	"@id": "2026-04-07-obsidian-vault-architecture",
	"@context": "tb",
	"data": "Decision: Obsidian Vault as Primary Memory Architecture\n\nContext\nAs the knowledge base grows, monolithic memory files (MEMORY.md, PROJECTS.md, RECENT.md) degrade in quality — they load entirely into context regardless of relevance, and fresh signal gets buried under stale noise.\n\nDecision\nAdopt an atomic-note Obsidian vault as the primary memory architecture for Calcifer. The vault lives at ~/.openclaw/workspace/vault/. cithoreal navigates via Obsidian app; Calcifer reads/writes via filesystem…",
